OL,3,GNEWSAAt-home cervical screenings to
OL,4,Aroll out in city
OL,5,
OL,6,FWomen in Wolverhampton who have not
OL,7,Fattended cervical screening
OL,8,Fappointments are to be offered home
OL,9,Ftesting for human papillomavirus (HPV).
OL,11,FThe NHS is rolling out the self-testing
OL,12,Fkits to increase screening numbers,
OL,13,Fwith data suggesting about a third of
OL,14,Fwomen are not up to date with
OL,15,Fappointments.
OL,17,FHPV is a common virus and some
OL,18,Fhigh-risk types can cause changes to
OL,19,Fcells in the cervix, which can develop
OL,20,Finto cervical cancer.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
